// Generic String :
"P3585370982" "The Seed of Hamidon has arrived to repopulate the Devouring Earth forces in First Ward! It will periodically drop Seedlings to the ground. These Seedlings come in five forms and provide different benefits to the Seed of Hamidon. Keeping the numbers of these Seedlings low will enable direct assaults against the Seed to be more successful, so be sure to defeat the Seedlings whenever you find them!"
// Generic String :
"P2077008991" "The Seed of Hamidon is assaulting First Ward!"
// Generic String :
"P341673908" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor DarkGoldenrod>You hear the voice of Vanessa DeVore projecting itself into your mind... <t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo> $name!  Clear your thoughts and focus on my voice - we'll only get one shot at this!<t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>The Seed of Hamidon is a powerful beast, capable of spreading the Tellurian Plague throughout First Ward.<t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Gather your allies and destroy its Seedlings, before we are all undone!"
